<!-- iOS Info.plist Permission Strings (Apple App Store Requirement) -->
<!-- When Capacitor generates ios/App/App/Info.plist, ensure these keys exist under <dict>: -->

<!-- Camera Access for Same-Day Workout/Meal Proof -->
<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
<string>SweatCircle requires camera access so you can take and post live photo proof of your workouts and meals for your group weekly streaks.</string>

<!-- Photo Library Access -->
<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
<string>SweatCircle requires photo library access to select same-day workout and meal photos.</string>

<!-- Apple HealthKit Access for Apple Watch & Connected Wearables -->
<key>NSHealthShareUsageDescription</key>
<string>SweatCircle reads active calories, exercise minutes, steps, and heart rate from Apple HealthKit to verify daily activity and stamp metrics onto your SweatCam photo cards.</string>

<key>NSHealthUpdateUsageDescription</key>
<string>SweatCircle accesses HealthKit to correlate workout durations with group streak goals.</string>
